                                                "sense_id": "3285b916-0a6c-396f-a50e-c3fb346b5c7f",
                                                "text": "“[…] Something must've happened to him when he was little.”\n“Which would give him a reason to hate them,” Oliver replied and was pushed aside by an alley of clowns. “Hey!”\n“Sorry, kid. Didn't see you there,” one clown called over."
